{
 "name": "scene3d",
 "about": "3D scenes (canvas v2 phase 4, 3.10): the guide's worked examples (the topology, a rack stacked inside a glass cabinet, a glTF arm on its bench, services around a hub) and every primitive once (a rotated box, grid and ring groups, text3d, arrow3d, a textured glTF packed from a .gltf with its .bin and .png), then a patch that adds a replica and saves an orbit view. The WEB e2e runs (S1-S5, S8, S9) drive the shared renderer here.",
 "stresses": [
  "relations and group layouts solved in Python",
  "glTF read, checked and packed into assets",
  "server projections as the agent's picture",
  "one shared WebGL renderer",
  "stills per view"
 ],
